epub_pro — CFI subsystem (packages/open_epub_engine/lib/src/cfi/)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Ported (adapted) from epub_pro, lib/src/cfi/{core,dom}/ — the EPUB CFI
parsing/serialization/DOM-navigation primitives only. epub_pro's own book model
(ref_entities) and the layers coupled to it (epub/, tracking/, split mappers)
were NOT ported; open_epub_engine bridges its own EpubBook via a self-authored
adapter (S12.2).

Source: https://github.com/watate/epub_pro
Origin: https://github.com/orthros/dart-epub

